<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banc One upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Banc One Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- On Monday Banc One said it was acquiring First USA Inc in a stock deal.</p>
<p>-- Banc One rose 23/32 to 42.</p>
</text>
